  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "人生在世！\n就必須要有個勁敵！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA751F57284E16FF01000A5C315FC5980889816709500B52C16575FF01FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你說的是！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608AAA7684662FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你還好吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F609084597D5427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是說吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8AAA5427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一點都不好！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E009EDE90FD4E0D597DFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來當我的勁敵吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F8675766211768452C165755427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我懂<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的困惑！\n但先聽我說說吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621161C200100003110000FF01014F6059B3768456F060D1FF01000A4F465148807D62118AAA8AAA5427FF01FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們兩個是同年、同月、同日生，\n一起著手培育同樣的寶可夢，炭小侍。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150115169500B662F540C5E743001540C67083001540C65E5751FFF0C000A4E008D778457624B57F980B2540C6A2376845BF653EF5922FF0C70AD5C0F4F8D300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "炭小侍是會根據道具不同，\n而有2種進化方向的寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70AD5C0F4F8D662F6703683964DA905351774E0D540CFF0C000A800C670900327A2E9032531665B9541176845BF653EF5922FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但炭小侍們總不能一直不變地\n走在同樣的道路上……因為是勁敵嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4670AD5C0F4F8D50117E3D4E0D80FD4E0076F44E0D8B8A5730000A8D705728540C6A23768490538DEF4E0A2026202656E070BA662F52C16575561B300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是一隻成了紅蓮鎧騎，\n另一隻成了蒼炎刃鬼。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我們彼此都讓炭小侍進化了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F4E0096BB62104E867D0584EE93A79A0EFF0C000A53E64E0096BB62104E8684BC708E52039B3C300200100001BE00000A621150115F7C6B6490FD8B9370AD5C0F4F8D903253164E86FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然後有一天……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71365F8C67094E0059292026202600100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們兩個就在命運的牽引下重逢，\n讓紅蓮鎧騎與蒼炎刃鬼對戰，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n一決雌雄！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150115169500B5C315728547D904B7684727D5F154E0B91CD9022FF0C000A8B937D0584EE93A79A0E820784BC708E52039B3C5C0D6230FF0C00100001BE00000A4E006C7A96CC96C4FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……這是我夢想中的熱血劇情，\n但別說是同一天出生的勁敵了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我連一個朋友也沒有！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來當我的勁敵吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620269019662F6211592260F34E2D768471B18840528760C5FF0C000A4F4652258AAA662F540C4E00592951FA751F768452C165754E86FF0C00100001BE00000A621190234E00500B670B53CB4E5F6C926709FF0100100001BE00000A62404EE5FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F8675766211768452C165755427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別擔心！讓炭小侍進化的\n慶祝之鎧和詛咒之鎧我都準備好了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522564D45FC3FF018B9370AD5C0F4F8D903253167684000A6176795D4E4B93A7548C8A5B54924E4B93A7621190FD6E965099597D4E86300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳其中一種！\n所以<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就讓炭小侍進化，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n讓我實現我理想中的對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211900100100003110000FF01014F6059B351764E2D4E007A2EFF01000A62404EE500100003110000FF01014F6059B35C318B9370AD5C0F4F8D90325316FF0C00100001BE00000A8B9362115BE673FE6211740660F34E2D76845C0D62305427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳決定要哪個鎧甲後，\n就來告訴我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36C7A5B9A898154EA500B93A775325F8CFF0C000A5C314F86544A8A3462115427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳決定好要哪個鎧甲了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36C7A5B9A597D898154EA500B93A775324E865427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "慶祝之鎧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6176795D4E4B93A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "詛咒之鎧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A5B54924E4B93A70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我還在煩惱",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190845728716960F10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要與<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳打一場命運之戰！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳盡情煩惱吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F38981820700100003110000FF01014F6059B362534E005834547D904B4E4B6230FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B376E160C5716960F15427FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "慶祝之鎧……\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要讓牠進化成紅蓮鎧騎啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6176795D4E4B93A720262026000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B389818B9372609032531662107D0584EE93A79A0E554AFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼我就用詛咒之鎧\n讓炭小侍進化成蒼炎刃鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC62115C3175288A5B54924E4B93A7000A8B9370AD5C0F4F8D90325316621084BC708E52039B3CFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來吧，炭小侍！\n讓你的雙手綻放蒼炎之力……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865427FF0C70AD5C0F4F8DFF01000A8B934F60768496D9624B7DBB653E84BC708E4E4B529B20262026FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "再來就等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳只用1隻紅蓮鎧騎\n來和我的蒼炎刃鬼一決勝負了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "518D4F865C317B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B353EA7528003196BB7D0584EE93A79A0E000A4F86548C6211768484BC708E52039B3C4E006C7A52DD8CA04E86FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蒼蒼炎！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "84BC84BC708EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "詛咒之鎧……\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要讓牠進化成蒼炎刃鬼啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A5B54924E4B93A720262026000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B389818B93726090325316621084BC708E52039B3C554AFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼我就用慶祝之鎧\n讓炭小侍進化成紅蓮鎧騎！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC62115C3175286176795D4E4B93A7000A8B9370AD5C0F4F8D9032531662107D0584EE93A79A0EFF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來吧，炭小侍！\n讓你的雙手綻放紅蓮之力……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865427FF0C70AD5C0F4F8DFF01000A8B934F60768496D9624B7DBB653E7D0584EE4E4B529B20262026FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳只用1隻蒼炎刃鬼\n來和我的紅蓮鎧騎一決勝負了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B353EA7528003196BB84BC708E52039B3C000A4F86548C621176847D0584EE93A79A0E4E006C7A52DD8CA04E86FF0100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "轟蓮蓮！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F5F84EE84EEFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們讓蒼炎刃鬼和紅蓮鎧騎\n展開命運之戰吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150118B9384BC708E52039B3C548C7D0584EE93A79A0E000A5C55958B547D904B4E4B62305427FF1F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能是2隻蒼炎刃鬼。\n得要是蒼炎刃鬼對上紅蓮鎧騎啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD662F003296BB84BC708E52039B3C3002000A5F978981662F84BC708E52039B3C5C0D4E0A7D0584EE93A79A0E554A300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……畢竟這是命運之戰。\n我會等到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳心甘情願的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF2026202675627ADF9019662F547D904B4E4B62303002000A621167037B49523000100003110000FF01014F6059B35FC3751860C598587684300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "終於能實現蒼炎刃鬼與紅蓮鎧騎的\n命運之戰了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那麼，就用我腦海中最棒的場面\n來一決勝負吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D4265BC80FD5BE673FE84BC708E52039B3C82077D0584EE93A79A0E7684000A547D904B4E4B62304E86300200100001BE01000A90A39EBCFF0C5C317528621181666D774E2D670068D2768458349762000A4F864E006C7A52DD8CA05427300200100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到與<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的重逢，\n竟然會是以這樣的形式呢……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D5230820700100003110000FF01014F6059B3768491CD9022FF0C000A7ADF71366703662F4EE590196A2376845F625F0F5462202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呵……<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓當時的炭小侍\n進化成紅蓮鎧騎了啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54752026202600100003110000FF01014F6059B38B9375766642768470AD5C0F4F8D000A9032531662107D0584EE93A79A0E4E86554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
